{"type":"api-request-blob","sessionId":"c986905c-e900-4fd9-bebc-4a3ce7ebb180","hash":"b3cd82b4dec64b3dbf19106ee368b068329ac4b910374240e4c625619f5ad223","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""},{"type":"text","text":"`Repr` and `LayoutWF` are decidable, and the smoke test tells a correct state from one missing its initialising write. Next: the MM-02 lemmas for allocation and write runs, then `repr_init`."},{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01HRuL3DisLjLVKYyGHunbQz","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd /Users/guygouri/Devlab/ernlang/ern/formal && sed -n 600,645p Ern/MM02.lean; sed -n 1239,1300p Ern/MM02.lean | grep -A6 'AllocStep_ok_iff\\|WriteStep_ok_iff\\|ReadStep_ok_iff\\|DeallocStep_ok_iff' | head -40","description":"Read MM02 wf lemmas and step ok-iff lemmas"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}]}}
