{"parentUuid":"332115ab-e32d-4f6d-9364-0d59a3c9e058","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgasqTPNqzjR8WgWj3pec","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01FRfDLor1W4Rdf8bGkDb5P2","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"git checkout formal/Ern/.gitkeep && git add formal/Ern.lean formal/Ern/MM23.lean && git commit -q -F - <<'EOF'\nMM23 pass 1, step 1: layout, representation relation, initial state (K1-K3)\n\nWhy: milestone 2 needs a justified representation relation between the\nabstract MM-03 states and the MM-02 machine before any refinement theorem.\n\nWhat: new module Ern.MM23 importing MM02 and MM03 unchanged.\n- Layout (K1): leaf -> MM-02 place (allocation, offset, size); LayoutWF\n  with clauses (a)-(c), (d) by the absence of a lower bound.\n- Repr tok L s3 s2 (K2, K3): LayoutWF, distinct roots in distinct\n  allocations, frame tokens, usable roots live, Init leaves initialised,\n  freed and exited roots dead, leaked owned storage live. Decidable.\n- Placement (K2) with obligation PlacementOK (AllocPre); topPlacement\n  satisfies it; placement_exists.\n- MM-02 operation sequences (Op2, exec, Along, AllOk, DecAlong for K5).\n- repr_extend (fresh roots), repr_writes (writes), repr_init.\n\nHow proved: lake build clean, no sorry/admit/axiom/native_decide; the 37\ntheorems use at most propext and Quot.sound; smoke test checks Repr on\nthe initial state both through repr_init and by decide, and rejects the\nstate without the static's write.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nEOF\ngit log --oneline -1","description":"Restore .gitkeep and commit step 1"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1095,"cache_read_input_tokens":456204,"output_tokens":729,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":59},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requ