{"parentUuid":"ed73f137-5ef1-4bd6-8ef6-6ae42f314fc4","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgatm4tYHhNgFkmDRjiWq","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Step 4 is committed. Now I'll move on to step 5, `exclusive_bytes`, proving a stronger form that doesn't require \"b active\" or \"b does not descend from a,\" since an active covering descendant already removes a's effective `Modify`.\n\n","signature":""}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":746,"cache_read_input_tokens":551855,"output_tokens":3061,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":1725},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":746,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":3061,"cache_read_input_tokens":551855,"cache_creation_input_tokens":746,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":746},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"thinkingDurationMs":1,"thinkingDisplay":"updates","serverClassifierRequest":"d4d44a4c-9e65-4114-a321-a6df3c5b9f7d","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011Cgatm4ZSpFyoREmYhC7KV","requestRef":"86dfd79e-5fcf-44e5-a8de-f7f3617b4016","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"23eb8b14-cdb6-438f-93ae-92966a731477","timestamp":"2026-10-31T19:48:31.867Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"xhigh","perTurnEffort":"xhigh","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/guygouri/Devlab/ernlang/ern","sessionId":"c986905c-e900-4fd9-bebc-4a3ce7ebb180","version":"2.1.309","gitBranch":"formal/refinement_0.1","slug":"effervescent-gathering-wind"}
{"parentUuid":"23eb8b14-cdb6-438f-93ae-92966a731477","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgatm4tYHhNgFkmDRjiWq","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_019tzi9dQ3ZVvuYBJG4rpjJJ","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd /Users/guygouri/Devlab/ernlang/ern/formal && python3 - <<'EOF'\np='Ern/MM23.lean'\ns=open(p).read()\nanchor=\"/-! ## Smoke test -/\"\nadd='''/-! ## Exclusive bytes (MM-03.3 §9.1.8) -/\n\n/-- `exclusive_bytes` (MM-03.3 §2.2, §9.1.8; K1 (b)): under I1 and `LayoutWF` (the clause `lwf` of\n`Repr`), if an authority `a` has the effective mode `Modify` on a leaf `l`, no other authority `b`\nhas an effective mode on a leaf `l'` whose range overlaps the range of `l` (same allocation, ranges\nnot disjoint). The task asks it of the active authorities that do not descend from `a`; neither\ncondition is used: an active descendant of `a` covering `l` would remove the effective `Modify` of\n`a` (MM-03.3.5), and an inactive authority has no effective mode. Memory justification of\nnon-aliasing, on the side of the kernel only. -/\ntheorem exclusive_bytes {L : Layout} {s3 : S3} {s2 : MM02.State} (hlw : LayoutWF L s3 s2)\n    (hI1 : I1 s3) {a b l l' : Nat} (hl : l < s3.P.length) (hlf : isLeaf s3.P l)\n    (hl' : l' < s3.P.length) (hlf' : isLeaf s3.P l') (ha : effective s3 a l = some .modify)\n    (hab : a ≠ b) (hsame : (L l).alloc = (L l').alloc)\n    (hover : ¬ MM02.RangeDisjoint (L l).off (L l).len (L l').off (L l').len) :\n    effective s3 b l' = none := by\n  by_cases e : l = l'\n  · subst e; exact effective_exclusive hI1 hab ha\n  · exact absurd (hlw.disjoint l hl l' hl' hlf hlf' e hsame) hover\n\n'''\ns=s.replace(anchor, add+anchor)\nopen(p,'w').write(s)\nEOF\n~/.elan/bin/lake build 2>&1 | grep -E \"warning|error|Build\" | head && SP=/private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-guygouri-Devlab-ernlang-ern/c986905c-e900-4fd9-bebc-4a3ce7ebb180/scratchpad/mm23 && sh $SP/axsweep23.sh $SP && cd .. && git checkout formal/Ern/.gitkeep 2>/dev/null; git add formal/Ern/MM23.lean && git commit -q -F - <<'EOF'\nMM23 pass 1, step 5: exclusive_bytes\n\nWhy: MM-03.3 §9.1.8 asks for the memory justification of non-aliasing on\nthe kernel side, before any lowering decision (Spec 13).\n\nWhat: exclusive_bytes: under I1 and LayoutWF (clause lwf of Repr), an\nauthority with effective Modify on a leaf excludes any effective mode of\nany other authority on a leaf whose byte range overlaps (same allocation,\nranges not disjoint). The task's conditions \"active\" and \"not descending\nfrom a\" are not needed and not assumed: the statement is stronger.\n\nHow proved: overlapping ranges force the same leaf (LayoutWF b), then\neffective_exclusive of MM03; lake build clean; the 71 theorems use at most\npropext and Quot.sound.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nEOF\ngit log --oneline -1","description":"Add exclusive_bytes, build, sweep, commit step 5"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":746,"cache_read_input_tokens":551855,"output_tokens":3061,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":1725},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":746,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":3061,"cache_read_input_tokens":551855,"cache_creation_input_tokens":746,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":746},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"wireToolInputs":{"toolu_019tzi9dQ3ZVvuYBJG4rpjJJ":{"command":"cd /Users/guygouri/Devlab/ernlang/ern/formal && python3 - <<'EOF'\np='Ern/MM23.lean'\ns=open(p).read()\nanchor=\"/-! ## Smoke test -/\"\nadd='''/-! ## Exclusive bytes (MM-03.3 §9.1.8) -/\n\n/-- `exclusive_bytes` (MM-03.3 §2.2, §9.1.8; K1 (b)): under I1 and `LayoutWF` (the clause `lwf` of\n`Repr`), if an authority `a` has the effective mode `Modify` on a leaf `l`, no other authority `b`\nhas an effective mode on a leaf `l'` whose range overlaps the range of `l` (same allocation, ranges\nnot disjoint). The task asks it of the active authorities that do not descend from `a`; neither\ncondition is used: an active descendant of `a` covering `l` would remove the effective `Modify` of\n`a` (MM-03.3.5), and an inactive authority has no effective mode. Memory justification of\nnon-aliasing, on the side of the kernel only. -/\ntheorem exclusive_bytes {L : Layout} {s3 : S3} {s2 : MM02.State} (hlw : LayoutWF L s3 s2)\n    (hI1 : I1 s3) {a b l l' : Nat} (hl : l < s3.P.length) (hlf : isLeaf s3.P l)\n    (hl' : l' < s3.P.length) (hlf' : isLeaf s3.P l') (ha : effective s3 a l = some .modify)\n    (hab : a ≠ b) (hsame : (L l).alloc = (L l').alloc)\n    (hover : ¬ MM02.RangeDisjoint (L l).off (L l).len (L l').off (L l').len) :\n    effective s3 b l' = none := by\n  by_cases e : l = l'\n  · subst e; exact effective_exclusive hI1 hab ha\n  · exact absurd (hlw.disjoint l hl l' hl' hlf hlf' e hsame) hover\n\n'''\ns=s.replace(anchor, add+anchor)\nopen(p,'w').write(s)\nEOF\n~/.elan/bin/lake build 2>&1 | grep -E \"warning|error|Build\" | head && SP=/private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-guygouri-Devlab-ernlang-ern/c986905c-e900-4fd9-bebc-4a3ce7ebb180/scratchpad/mm23 && sh $SP/axsweep23.sh $SP && cd .. && git checkout formal/Ern/.gitkeep 2>/dev/null; git add formal/Ern/MM23.lean && git commit -q -F - <<'EOF'\nMM23 pass 1, step 5: exclusive_bytes\n\nWhy: MM-03.3 §9.1.8 asks for the memory justification of non-aliasing on\nthe kernel side, before any lowering decision (Spec 13).\n\nWhat: exclusive_bytes: under I1 and LayoutWF (clause lwf of Repr), an\nauthority with effective Modify on a leaf excludes any effective mode of\nany other authority on a leaf whose byte range overlaps (same allocation,\nranges not disjoint). The task's conditions \"active\" and \"not descending\nfrom a\" are not needed and not assumed: the statement is stronger.\n\nHow proved: overlapping ranges force the same leaf (LayoutWF b), then\neffective_exclusive of MM03; lake build clean; the 71 theorems use at most\npropext and Quot.sound.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nEOF\ngit log --oneline -1","description":"Add exclusive_bytes, build, sweep, commit step 5"}},"serverClassifierRequest":"d4d44a4c-9e65-4114-a321-a6df3c5b9f7d","apiBlockIndex":2,"requestId":"req_011Cgatm4ZSpFyoREmYhC7KV","requestRef":"86dfd79e-5fcf-44e5-a8de-f7f3617b4016","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"c4e27a2c-c357-470f-8191-3752d6125eab","timestamp":"2026-10-31T19:48:41.231Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"xhigh","perTurnEffort":"xhigh","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/guygouri/Devlab/ernlang/ern","sessionId":"c986905c-e900-4fd9-bebc-4a3ce7ebb180","version":"2.1.309","gitBranch":"formal/refinement_0.1","slug":"effervescent-gathering-wind"}
