{"parentUuid":"892737d8-fa66-494b-9eed-29a3fadcc4c7","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgauEFVX6BGjrEkBhDfat","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_016MDA4RyhFAcjZLgJZQvsQM","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"~/.elan/bin/lake build 2>&1 | grep -E \"warning|error|Build\" | head; SP=/private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-guygouri-Devlab-ernlang-ern/c986905c-e900-4fd9-bebc-4a3ce7ebb180/scratchpad/mm23 && sh $SP/axsweep23.sh $SP && cd .. && grep -rnE '\\b(sorry|admit|native_decide)\\b|^\\s*axiom\\b' --include='*.lean' --exclude-dir=.lake .; grep -c noncomputable formal/Ern/MM23.lean; git checkout formal/Ern/.gitkeep 2>/dev/null; git add formal/Ern/MM23.lean && git commit -q -F - <<'EOF'\nMM23 pass 1, step 6: cases from S3.init\n\nWhy: every refinement theorem needs a witness where its conclusion is not\ntrivial, and Repr must be shown to reject wrong MM-02 states.\n\nWhat: one scenario reached from S3.init (Reachable proofs r0-r16, rf)\ncovering every operation of K4: enterFrame, write3, writeShared, read3,\nderive, release, split, depend, pin, unpin, alloc ok and fail, free,\nnewArena, reset, endUse, exitFrame. For each, the MM-03 step is decided,\nRepr is checked by decide on both sides, and the R6 theorem is applied to\nthe exhibited MM-02 sequence (bases 16/28/40/52, tokens, deallocations of\nallocations 1-3 at exit, leak of allocation 4). Plus: read value equal to\nthe written bytes; K1 (d) zero-size leaf; exclusive_bytes non-trivial\ninstance and an overlapping layout rejected; R4 on the exited state; each\nRepr clause rejecting a wrong MM-02 state; counterexamples kept (R1\nwithout NoDangling; two-root alloc accepted by the draft, not\nrepresentable by one AllocStep).\n\nHow proved: lake build clean; no sorry/admit/axiom/native_decide; all\ntheorems use at most propext and Quot.sound.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nEOF\ngit log --oneline -1","description":"Build, sweep and commit step 6"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":405,"cache_read_input_tokens":599846,"output_tokens":1484,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":588},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":405,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1484,"cache_read_input_tokens":599846,"cache_creation_input_tokens":405,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":405},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"wireToolInputs":{"toolu_016MDA4RyhFAcjZLgJZQvsQM":{"command":"cd /Users/guygouri/Devlab/ernlang/ern/formal && ~/.elan/bin/lake build 2>&1 | grep -E \"warning|error|Build\" | head; SP=/private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-guygouri-Devlab-ernlang-ern/c986905c-e900-4fd9-bebc-4a3ce7ebb180/scratchpad/mm23 && sh $SP/axsweep23.sh $SP && cd .. && grep -rnE '\\b(sorry|admit|native_decide)\\b|^\\s*axiom\\b' --include='*.lean' --exclude-dir=.lake .; grep -c noncomputable formal/Ern/MM23.lean; git checkout formal/Ern/.gitkeep 2>/dev/null; git add formal/Ern/MM23.lean && git commit -q -F - <<'EOF'\nMM23 pass 1, step 6: cases from S3.init\n\nWhy: every refinement theorem needs a witness where its conclusion is not\ntrivial, and Repr must be shown to reject wrong MM-02 states.\n\nWhat: one scenario reached from S3.init (Reachable proofs r0-r16, rf)\ncovering every operation of K4: enterFrame, write3, writeShared, read3,\nderive, release, split, depend, pin, unpin, alloc ok and fail, free,\nnewArena, reset, endUse, exitFrame. For each, the MM-03 step is decided,\nRepr is checked by decide on both sides, and the R6 theorem is applied to\nthe exhibited MM-02 sequence (bases 16/28/40/52, tokens, deallocations of\nallocations 1-3 at exit, leak of allocation 4). Plus: read value equal to\nthe written bytes; K1 (d) zero-size leaf; exclusive_bytes non-trivial\ninstance and an overlapping layout rejected; R4 on the exited state; each\nRepr clause rejecting a wrong MM-02 state; counterexamples kept (R1\nwithout NoDangling; two-root alloc accepted by the draft, not\nrepresentable by one AllocStep).\n\nHow proved: lake build clean; no sorry/admit/axiom/native_decide; all\ntheorems use at most propext and Quot.sound.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nEOF\ngit log --oneline -1","description":"Build, sweep and commit step 6"}},"wireIngestContext":{"toolu_016MDA4RyhFAcjZLgJZQvsQM":{"cwd":"/Users/guygouri/Devlab/ernlang/ern/formal"}},"serverClassifierRequest":"f891f67e-beb7-43b6-9be8-3e5353a1c23a","apiBlockIndex":2,"requestId":"req_011CgauEFBurp3wuxYcZxbg6","requestRef":"8b4acfb3-b8b6-48e7-b249-b8fa4553c254","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"e24ecdd2-f2a3-404f-a54c-cd42e6a2a34b","timestamp":"2026-10-31T19:54:38.138Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"xhigh","perTurnEffort":"xhigh","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/guygouri/Devlab/ernlang/ern/formal","sessionId":"c986905c-e900-4fd9-bebc-4a3ce7ebb180","version":"2.1.309","gitBranch":"formal/refinement_0.1","slug":"effervescent-gathering-wind"}
