ng-wind"}
{"parentUuid":"dcfedb36-d1fd-43bb-aac3-b51dac932134","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"environment","snapshot":{"workingDirectory":"/Users/guygouri/Devlab/ernlang/ern","isWorktree":false,"isGitRepo":true,"additionalWorkingDirectories":[],"platform":"darwin","shell":"zsh","osVersion":"Darwin 27.0.0","scratchpadDirectory":"/private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-guygouri-Devlab-ernlang-ern/c986905c-e900-4fd9-bebc-4a3ce7ebb180/scratchpad"},"changes":[{"field":"workingDirectory","from":"/Users/guygouri/Devlab/ernlang/ern/formal"}]},"type":"attachment","uuid":"27e34ccb-2b80-49e4-815e-220ec6646b8f","timestamp":"2026-10-31T19:54:46.345Z","rendered":[{"content":"<system-reminder>\n# Environment update\n - Primary working directory: /Users/guygouri/Devlab/ernlang/ern (was /Users/guygouri/Devlab/ernlang/ern/formal)\n</system-reminder>"}],"renderedRole":"system","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/guygouri/Devlab/ernlang/ern","sessionId":"c986905c-e900-4fd9-bebc-4a3ce7ebb180","version":"2.1.309","gitBranch":"formal/refinement_0.1","slug":"effervescent-gathering-wind"}
{"type":"api-request-blob","sessionId":"c986905c-e900-4fd9-bebc-4a3ce7ebb180","hash":"1fe116e25cd2232bb4503e9a0cdf403e46b7e35a59f1a4ad58c1a6bf64d8fb39","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""},{"type":"text","text":"The cases compile. Building, sweeping and committing step 6."},{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_016MDA4RyhFAcjZLgJZQvsQM","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd /Users/guygouri/Devlab/ernlang/ern/formal && ~/.elan/bin/lake build 2>&1 | grep -E \"warning|error|Build\" | head; SP=/private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-guygouri-Devlab-ernlang-ern/c986905c-e900-4fd9-bebc-4a3ce7ebb180/scratchpad/mm23 && sh $SP/axsweep23.sh $SP && cd .. && grep -rnE '\\b(sorry|admit|native_decide)\\b|^\\s*axiom\\b' --include='*.lean' --exclude-dir=.lake .; grep -c noncomputable formal/Ern/MM23.lean; git checkout formal/Ern/.gitkeep 2>/dev/null; git add formal/Ern/MM23.lean && git commit -q -F - <<'EOF'\nMM23 pass 1, step 6: cases from S3.init\n\nWhy: every refinement theorem needs a witness where its conclusion is not\ntrivial, and Repr must be shown to reject wrong MM-02 states.\n\nWhat: one scenario reached from S3.init (Reachable proofs r0-r16, rf)\ncovering every operation of K4: enterFrame, write3, writeShared, read3,\nderive, release, split, depend, pin, unpin, alloc ok and fail, free,\nnewArena, reset, endUse, exitFrame. For each, the MM-03 step is decided,\nRepr is checked by decide on both sides, and the R6 theorem is applied to\nthe exhibited MM-02 sequence (bases 16/28/40/52, tokens, deallocations of\nallocations 1-3 at exit, leak of allocation 4). Plus: read value equal to\nthe written bytes; K1 (d) zero-size leaf; exclusive_bytes non-trivial\ninstance and an overlapping layout rejected; R4 on the exited state; each\nRepr clause rejecting a wrong MM-02 state; counterexamples kept (R1\nwithout NoDangling; two-root alloc accepted by the draft, not\nrepresentable by one AllocStep).\n\nHow proved: lake build clean; no sorry/admit/axiom/native_decide; all\ntheorems use at most propext and Quot.sound.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nEOF\ngit log --oneline -1","description":"Build, sweep and commit step 6"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}]}}
