 their effects. Each R6\ntheorem is applied to a step of one scenario reached from `S3.init`.\"\"\",\"\"\"decidable; the MM-02 sequences are exhibited by the definitions `opsN` and their effects. Each\nrefinement theorem is applied to a step of one scenario reached from `S3.init`.\"\"\")\nopen(p,'w').write(s)\nEOF\ngrep -n \"^theorem is\" Ern/MM23.lean; sed -n 1,15p Ern/MM23.lean","description":"Reword a docstring line starting with \"theorem\""}},"serverClassifierRequest":"85738232-3cbf-4797-8257-727c4d97ccd2","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CgauQyRSNMse6fKgSH2JU","requestRef":"52a3988c-67ff-414a-944f-f66ba35dfdde","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"0a3abb4b-aadb-4964-8622-e48f2cfedef6","timestamp":"2026-10-31T19:56:52.664Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"xhigh","perTurnEffort":"xhigh","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/guygouri/Devlab/ernlang/ern","sessionId":"c986905c-e900-4fd9-bebc-4a3ce7ebb180","version":"2.1.309","gitBranch":"formal/refinement_0.1","slug":"effervescent-gathering-wind"}
{"parentUuid":"0a3abb4b-aadb-4964-8622-e48f2cfedef6","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"06503e62-b7bb-46dd-8bf0-90c46d6d2b97","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01WBbmvc9izQ1aeo1Got7DV7","type":"tool_result","content":"1032:theorem isLeaf_of_parentOf {P P' : List Place} (hlen : P'.length = P.length)\nimport Ern.MM02\nimport Ern.MM03\n\n/-!\n# Refinement MM-03.3 v0.3 → MM-02 v0.4 (milestone 2, pass 1)\n\nRepresentation of the abstract states of MM-03.3 (module `Ern.MM03`) by the states of the abstract\nmachine of MM-02 (module `Ern.MM02`), and refinement of the operations in the scope of the\narbitrage K4 of the task. Both modules are imported unchanged; a lemma they lack is proved here.\n\nThe arbitrages K1–K5 of the task are cited as `K1`…`K5`. The rules of the specifications are cited\nas `MM-02.x` (MM-02 v0.4) and `MM-03.3 …` (MM-03.3 v0.3 révisée). Out of scope: `transfer`,\n`store`, `issue`, concurrency, real `DDSound`, stability of pinned addresses, low-level translation.\n-/","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"d9a817d4-92e3-475d-afa4-53cd68b13f92","timestamp":"2026-10-31T19:56:53.640Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"1032:theorem isLeaf_of_parentOf {P P' : List Place} (hlen : P'.length = P.length)\nimport Ern.MM02\nimport Ern.MM03\n\n/-!\n# Refinement MM-03.3 v0.3 → MM-02 v0.4 (milestone 2, pass 1)\n\nRepresentation of the abstract states of MM-03.3 (module `Ern.MM03`) by the states of the abstract\nmachine of MM-02 (module `Ern.MM02`), and refinement of the operations in the scope of the\narbitrage K4 of the task. Both modules are imported unchanged; a lemma they lack is proved here.\n\nThe arbitrages K1–K5 of the task are cited as `K1`…`K5`. The rules of the specifications are cited\nas `MM-02.x` (MM-02 v0.4) and `MM-03.3 …` (MM-03.3 v0.3 révisée). Out of scope: `transfer`,\n`store`, `issue`, concurrency, real `DDSound`, stability of pinned addresses, low-level translation.\n-/","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false,"bashEditDiff":{"files":[{"filePath":"/Users/guygouri/Devlab/ernlang/ern/formal/Ern/MM23.lean","hunks":[{"oldStart":1802,"oldLines":8,"newStart":1802,"newLines":8,"lines":[" /-! ## Cases (step 6 of the task)"," "," Each verdict is checked by `decide` on the precondition of the MM-03 step and on `Repr`, which is","-decidable; the MM-02 sequences are exhibited by the definitions `opsN` and their effects. Each R6","-theorem is applied to a step of one scenario reached from `S3.init`. The obligations `dec` of the","+decidable; the MM-02 sequences are exhibited by the definitions `opsN` and their effects. Each","+refinement theorem is applied to a step of one scenario reached from `S3.init`. The obligations `dec` of the"," test cases ask an access aligned on 4 bytes, a non-trivial instance (K5); `stat` is `True`, as K5"," fixes for the sequential fragment. -/"," "]}]}],"moreFiles":0,"changedFiles":["/Users/guygouri/Devlab/ernlang/ern/formal/Ern/MM23.lean"]}},"serverClassifierContext":{"request":"85738232-3cbf-4797-8257-727c4d97ccd2","context":{"git_state":{"cwd":"/Users/guygouri/Devlab/ernlang/ern","root":"/Users/guygouri/Devlab/ernlang/ern","branch":"formal/refinement_0.1","default_branch":null,"status":{"clean":true,"counts":{"staged":0,"modified":0,"untracked":null,"untracked_normal":0},"porcelain":null,"truncated":false},"visibility":{"origin":{"host":"github.com","remote":"ernlang/ern","visibility":"public"},"push_remote":"origin","remotes":[{"name":"origin","host":"github.com","remote":"ernlang/ern","visibility":"public"}],"visibility_cache":[{"host":"github.com","remote":"ernlang/ern","visibility":"public"}]}},"live_cwd":"/Users/guygouri/Devlab/ernlang/ern","platform":"macos"}},"sandboxed":false,"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"0a3abb4b-aadb-4964-8622-e48f2cfedef6","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reasonType":"classifier"},"userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/guygouri/Devlab/ernlang/ern/formal","se