cation 1 reste vivante après la sortie.\n   - Argument hors passe, sans témoin puisque `transfer` est hors périmètre : si la possession du\n     local est transférée hors du cadre, sa racine survit, et la désallouer contredirait la clause\n     `live` de `Repr`.\n\n   Quelle lecture retenir ?"}},"serverClassifierRequest":"f579de33-59ff-499b-afb4-fc07c98f215c","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CgaubQWLJ37KRT6cvGjLV","requestRef":"5c58ec05-5680-4dda-9883-c81566af2186","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"61869cbe-f025-4f1f-b314-da5a79552f96","timestamp":"2026-10-31T19:59:19.062Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"xhigh","perTurnEffort":"xhigh","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/guygouri/Devlab/ernlang/ern/formal","sessionId":"c986905c-e900-4fd9-bebc-4a3ce7ebb180","version":"2.1.309","gitBranch":"formal/refinement_0.1","slug":"effervescent-gathering-wind"}
