R1 applied directly to the read of leaf 1 in `e3`: an allocation, the range initialised, a","+read of outcome `ok` with the bytes of the range, never `ub`. -/","+example : ∃ al, m3.allocs (L 1).alloc = some al ∧ al.InitRange (L 1).off (L 1).len ∧","+    MM02.ReadStep obR (leafAcc m3 L .read 1) m3 (.ok (al.bytesAt (L 1).off (L 1).len)) ∧","+    ¬ MM02.ReadStep obR (leafAcc m3 L .read 1) m3 .ub :=","+  r1_read3 (reachable_invariants kc_dd r3).1 (reachable_invariants kc_dd r3).2.1.nd","+    (reachable_fpLeaves_frameOwnedLive kc_dd r3).1 (by decide)","+    (.ok (by decide) : Read3Step 1 [1] e3 (.ok e3)) (fun _ _ => trivial) (fun l hl => by","+      rw [List.mem_singleton] at hl; subst hl; show (leafAcc m3 L .read 1).addr % 4 = 0; decide)","+    1 (List.mem_singleton_self _)","+","+/-- Gap kept (report, (f) 4): after `free` of 6, the storage 7 it owns stops being usable but is","+not marked dead, where O13 marks dead \"le stockage qui cesse de vivre\". -/","+example : af14.dead 7 = false ∧ ¬ af14.Usable 7 := by decide","+"," end Cases"," "," namespace CaseOwnedLocal"]}]}],"moreFiles":0,"changedFiles":["/Users/guygouri/Devlab/ernlang/ern/formal/Ern/MM23.lean"]}},"serverClassifierContext":{"request":"ae4961a4-d8bf-4422-947e-cc855e3e13dd","context":{"git_state":{"cwd":"/Users/guygouri/Devlab/ernlang/ern/formal","root":"/Users/guygouri/Devlab/ernlang/ern","branch":"formal/refinement_0.1","default_branch":null,"status":{"clean":false,"counts":{"staged":0,"modified":1,"untracked":null,"untracked_normal":1},"porcelain":null,"truncated":false},"visibility":{"origin":{"host":"github.com","remote":"ernlang/ern","visibility":"public"},"push_remote":"origin","remotes":[{"name":"origin","host":"github.com","remote":"ernlang/ern","visibility":"public"}],"visibility_cache":[{"host":"github.com","remote":"ernlang/ern","visibility":"public"}]}},"live_cwd":"/Users/guygouri/Devlab/ernlang/ern/formal","platform":"macos"}},"sandboxed":false,"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"01b5bd0c-45d9-478e-8761-