   print(f\"\\n## {f['lens']}/{f['id']} [{f['severity']}] {f['location']}\\nCLAIM: {f['claim']}\\nFIX: {f['fix']}\")\nprint(\"\\nREFUTED\", len(d['refuted']))\nfor f in d['refuted']:\n    print(f\"- {f['lens']}/{f['id']}: {f['claim'][:220]} || {f['reason'][:260]}\")\nEOF","description":"Summarize the second-check findings"}},"serverClassifierRequest":"9ed94109-0854-4c02-bb13-cd43084102b8","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgawoSjr1o11iiamF2RXo","requestRef":"fd3e2946-b49d-4cec-bbae-0c3267d8708b","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"52db2d98-5456-4537-83c7-9fd7a3db7072","timestamp":"2026-10-31T20:28:11.463Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"xhigh","perTurnEffort":"xhigh","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/guygouri/Devlab/ernlang/ern","sessionId":"c986905c-e900-4fd9-bebc-4a3ce7ebb180","version":"2.1.309","gitBranch":"formal/refinement_0.1","slug":"effervescent-gathering-wind"}
{"parentUuid":"52db2d98-5456-4537-83c7-9fd7a3db7072","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"a423a2dd-93c8-4247-9f26-f7dc164834a5","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_012KFdBZyMA18KYvsGwVc7Sd","type":"tool_result","content":"CONFIRMED 4\n\n## report/F1 [major] formal/reports/MM23_v0.1.md, Résultats principaux 3\nCLAIM: Point 3 now says the MM-03 hypotheses are proved on reached states, with no condition. They are proved only under `DDSound k`. Its list of open obligations ('Les autres restent des obligations ouvertes, voir (d) 4') leaves out `DDSound`, and (d) 4 does not list it either.\nFIX: Write 'sont prouvées sur les états atteints sous `DDSound k`'. Add `DDSound` to the list of open obligations, pointing to (d) 6 or adding it to (d) 4. Optionally name `I1` with the MM-03 hypotheses proved on reached states.\n\n## report/F3 [minor] formal/reports/MM23_v0.1.md, (b) preamble\nCLAIM: The rewritten per-theorem list of MM-02 hypotheses is incomplete, and its closing line is false. `PlacementOK` is also a hypothesis of `repr_init`. The `MM02.Pow2` alignment hypotheses are not mentioned. 'les autres théorèmes n'ont pas d'hypothèse MM-02' is false for `r6_free`, whose `FreeSound` is a predicate on the MM-02 state `s2`.\nFIX: Add `repr_init` to the PlacementOK line. Mention the alignment hypotheses (`MM02.Pow2`) of r6_alloc, r6_enter and repr_init. Either say that r6_free's `FreeSound` reads `s2` (and r6_exit's `TokCompat` reads MM-02's `Compatible`), or drop 'les autres théorèmes n'ont pas d'hypothèse MM-02'.\n\n## report/F4 [minor] formal/reports/MM23_v0.1.md, Résultats principaux 4, last bullet\nCLAIM: The summary says (f) 4 to (f) 6 are missing from `WF3`. (f) 4 is not about `WF3`: it is about the step effects `freeS` and `endUseS`. Also, the draft `WF3` does have a `RootHeld` clause; what is missing is the existence requirement of spec clause 7, which (f) 5 states correctly.\nFIX: Reword along these lines: '(f) 4 : `freeS` et `endUseS` ne marquent pas morts tout le stockage possédé qui cesse de vivre ; (f) 5, (f) 6 : `WF3` n'exige ni l'autorité racine active de chaque racine utilisable (clause 7) ni des chaînes de possession bien fondées (clause 3).'\n\n## module/F1 [minor] formal/Ern/MM23.lean:2203-2206 (docstring of DraftGaps.sNoRoot); formal/reports/MM23_v0.1.md (f) 5\nCLAIM: The sNoRoot docstring and report (f) 5 say RootLive holds on the reached states, but the cited theorem only proves this under DDSound k. That hypothesis is still open: report (d) 6 puts 'DDSound réel' outside the pass. Neither text mentions it.\nFIX: Add \"under `DDSound k`\" to the sNoRoot docstring and \"sous `DDSound k`\" to report (f) 5.\n\nREFUTED 1\n- report/F2: `MM02.WF` and `stat` are listed as open obligations, but both are settled. (d) 4 says `MM02.WF` is 'supposé au départ', yet the module proves it on the K3 starting state and on every state reached from it by `exec`. K5 f || The finding does not hold up. On `MM02.WF`: `r6_alloc` and `r6_enter` take `MM02.WF s2` as a hypothesis about an arbitrary state `s2`. Neither theorem has a `_reachable` corollary that discharges it, and no simulation theorem links such an `s2` to `exec State.\nShell cwd was reset to /Users/guygouri/Devlab/ernlang/ern","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"22945c35-3543-4cec-877d-16643d5052a1","timestamp":"2026-10-31T20:28:12.484Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"CONFIRMED 4\n\n## report/F1 [major] formal/reports/MM23_v0.1.md, Résultats principaux 3\nCLAIM: Point 3 now says the MM-03 hypotheses are proved on reached states, with no condition. They are proved only under `DDSound k`. Its list of open obligations ('Les autres restent des obligations ouvertes, voir (d) 4') leaves out `DDSound`, and (d) 4 does not list it either.\nFIX: Write 'sont prouvées sur les états atteints sous `DDSound k`'. Add `DDSound` to the list of open obligations, pointing to (d) 6 or adding it to (d) 4. Optionally name `I1` with the MM-03 hypotheses proved on reached states.\n\n## report/F3 [minor] formal/reports/MM23_v0.1.md, (b) preamble\nCLAIM: The rewritten per-theorem list of MM-02 hypotheses is incomplete, and its closing line is false. `PlacementOK` is also a hypothesis of `repr_init`. The `MM02.Pow2` alignment hypotheses are not mentioned. 'les autres théorèmes n'ont pas d'hypothèse MM-02' is false for `r6_free`, whose `FreeSound` is a predicate on the MM-02 state `s2`.\nFIX: Add `repr_init` to the PlacementOK line. Mention the alignment hypotheses (`MM02.Pow2`) of r6_alloc, r6_enter and repr_init. Either say that r6_free's `FreeSound` reads `s2` (and r6_exit's `TokCompat` reads MM-02's `Compatible`), or drop 'les autres théorèmes n'ont pas d'hypothèse MM-02'.\n\n## report/F4 [minor] formal/reports/MM23_v0.1.md, Résultats principaux 4, last bullet\nCLAIM: The summary says (f) 4 to (f) 6 are missing from `WF3`. (f) 4 is not about `WF3`: it is about the step effects `freeS` and `endUseS`. Also, the draft `WF3` does have a `RootHeld` clause; what is missing is the existence requirement of spec clause 7, which (f) 5 states correctly.\nFIX: Reword along these lines: '(f) 4 : `freeS` et `endUseS` ne marquent pas morts tout le stockage possédé qui cesse de vivre ; (f) 5, (f) 6 : `WF3` n'exige ni l'autorité racine active de chaque racine utilisable (clause 7) ni des chaînes de possession bien fondées (clause 3).'\n\n## module/F1 [minor] formal/Ern/MM23.lean:2203-2206 (docstring of DraftGaps.sNoRoot); formal/reports/MM23_v0.1.md (f) 5\nCLAIM: The sNoRoot docstring and report (f) 5 say RootLive holds on the reached states, but the cited theorem only proves this under DDSound k. That hypothesis is still open: report (d) 6 puts 'DDSound réel' outside the pass. Neither text mentions it.\nFIX: Add \"under `DDSound k`\" to the sNoRoot docstring and \"sous `DDSound k`\" to report (f) 5.\n\nREFUTED 1\n- report/F2: `MM02.WF` and `stat` are listed as open obligations, but both are settled. (d) 4 says `MM02.WF` is 'supposé au départ', yet the module proves it on the K3 starting state and on every state reached from it by `exec`. K5 f || The finding does not hold up. On `MM02.WF`: `r6_alloc` and `r6_enter` take `MM02.WF s2` as a hypothesis about an arbitrary state `s2`. Neither theorem has a `_reachable` corollary that discharges it, and no simulation theorem links such an `s2` to `exec State.","stderr":"\nShell cwd was reset to /Users/guygouri/Devlab/ernlang/ern","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"serverClassifierContext":{"request":"9ed94109-0854-4c02-bb13-cd43084102b8","context":{"git_state":{"cwd":"/Users/guygouri/Devlab/ernlang/ern","root":"/Users/guygouri/Devlab/ernlang/ern","branch":"formal/refinement_0.1","default_branch":null,"status":{"clean":true,"counts":{"staged":0,"modified":0,"untracked":null,"untracked_normal":0},"porcelain":null,"truncated":false},"visibility":{"origin":{"host":"github.com","remote":"ernlang/ern","visibility":"public"},"push_remote":"origin","remotes":[{"name":"origin","host":"github.com","remote":"ernlang/ern","visibility":"public"}],"visibility_cache":[{"host":"github.com","remote":"ernlang/ern","visibility":"public"}]}},"live_cwd":"/Users/guygouri/Devlab/ernlang/ern","platform":"macos"}},"sandboxed":false,"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"52db2d98-5456-4537-83c7-9fd7a3db7072","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reasonType":"classifier"},"userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/guygouri/Devlab/ernlang/ern","sessionId":"c986905c-e900-4fd9-bebc-4a3ce7ebb180","version":"2.1.309","gitBranch":"formal/refinement_0.1","slug":"effervescent-gathering-wind"}
