"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"fd867c6b-87e1-40a6-9984-38f81be320d1","timestamp":"2026-10-31T22:00:36.607Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"xhigh","perTurnEffort":"xhigh","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/guygouri/Devlab/ernlang/ern/formal","sessionId":"c986905c-e900-4fd9-bebc-4a3ce7ebb180","version":"2.1.309","gitBranch":"formal/refinement_0.1","slug":"effervescent-gathering-wind"}
{"parentUuid":"fd867c6b-87e1-40a6-9984-38f81be320d1","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"afea6d65-2af9-420c-969b-b55d07c96f18","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01STEz1Nrp3UZnszEiaXQWiF","type":"tool_result","content":"  | .frame f => some (tok f)\n  | .place _ => none\n\n/-- K3, relation of representation `Repr` between an MM-03 state `s3` and an MM-02 state `s2`, for\nthe layout `L` and the frame tokens `tok`:\n- `lwf`: `LayoutWF` (K1);\n- `inj`: two distinct root places are in distinct allocations (K2: a root corresponds to an\n  allocation; a part to a sub-range of the allocation of its root, by `LayoutWF.sameAlloc`);\n- `tokens`: the allocation of a root owned by the frame `f` has the token `tok f` (K2);\n- `live`: every usable root has its allocation live (K3);\n- `init`: every `Init` leaf has all its bytes initialised (K3);\n- `freed`: a root dead by `free` has its allocation dead (K3);\n- `exited`: a root dead by the exit of its frame has its allocation dead (K3);\n- `leaked`: a root owned by a place, not usable and not freed keeps its allocation live. K3 says\n  it of a root dead by `endUse`; the clause also covers owned storage that dies with its frame (K4:\n  no `DeallocStep` for it) or with a freed root (K4 read as one `DeallocStep`, of the freed root):\n  report, (c) 4 and (e) 7.\n`Repr` does not read the contracts `K`: no clause of K3 depends on them. -/\nstructure Repr (tok : Nat → Nat) (L : Layout) (s3 : S3) (s2 : MM02.State) : Prop where\n  lwf : LayoutWF L s3 s2\n  inj : ∀ r < s3.P.length, ∀ r' < s3.P.length, RootPlace s3.P r → RootPlace s3.P r' → r ≠ r' →\n    ∀ l ∈ footprint s3.P r, ∀ l' ∈ footprint s3.P r', (L l).alloc ≠ (L l').alloc\n  tokens : ∀ r < s3.P.length, RootPlace s3.P r → OptP (s3.P[r]?) (fun pl =>\n    OptP (tokOf tok pl.owner) (fun d => ∀ l ∈ footprint s3.P r,\n      AllocP s2 (L l).alloc (·.freeAuth = some d)) True) True\n  live : ∀ r < s3.P.length, RootPlace s3.P r → s3.Usable r → ∀ l ∈ footprint s3.P r,\n    LiveAlloc s2 (L l).alloc\n  init : ∀ l < s3.P.length, isLeaf s3.P l → s3.I l = .init →\n    AllocP s2 (L l).alloc fun a => a.InitRange (L l).off (L l).len\n  freed : ∀ r < s3.P.length, RootPlace s3.P r → s3.freed r = true → ∀ l ∈ footprint s3.P r,\n    DeadAlloc s2 (L l).alloc\n  exited : ∀ r < s3.P.length, RootPlace s3.P r → OptP (s3.P[r]?) (fun pl => FrameGone s3.F pl.owner)\n    False → ∀ l ∈ footprint s3.P r, DeadAlloc s2 (L l).alloc\n  leaked : ∀ r < s3.P.length, RootPlace s3.P r → ¬ s3.Usable r → s3.freed r = false →\n    OptP (s3.P[r]?) (fun pl => pl.owner.isPlace = true) False → ∀ l ∈ footprint s3.P r,\n    LiveAlloc s2 (L l).alloc\n\nset_option synthInstance.maxSize 4096 in\ninstance (tok : Nat → Nat) (L : Layout) (s3 : S3) (s2 : MM02.State) :\n    Decidable (Repr tok L s3 s2) :=\n  decidable_of_iff\n    (LayoutWF L s3 s2 ∧\n     (∀ r < s3.P.length, ∀ r' < s3.P.length, RootPlace s3.P r → RootPlace s3.P r' → r ≠ r' →\n      ∀ l ∈ footprint s3.P r, ∀ l' ∈ footprint s3.P r', (L l).alloc ≠ (L l').alloc) ∧\n     (∀ r < s3.P.length, RootPlace s3.P r → OptP (s3.P[r]?) (fun pl =>\n      OptP (tokOf tok pl.owner) (fun d => ∀ l ∈ footprint s3.P r,\n        AllocP s2 (L l).alloc (·.freeAuth = some d)) True) True) ∧\n     (∀ r < s3.P.length, RootPlace s3.P r → s3.Usable r → ∀ l ∈ footprint s3.P r,\n      LiveAlloc s2 (L l).alloc) ∧\n     (∀ l < s3.P.length, isLeaf s3.P l → s3.I l = .init →\n      AllocP s2 (L l).alloc fun a => a.InitRange (L l).off (L l).len) ∧\n     (∀ r < s3.P.length, RootPlace s3.P r → s3.freed r = true → ∀ l ∈ footprint s3.P r,\n      DeadAlloc s2 (L l).alloc) ∧\n     (∀ r < s3.P.length, RootPlace s3.P r →\n      OptP (s3.P[r]?) (fun pl => FrameGone s3.F pl.owner) False → ∀ l ∈ footprint s3.P r,\n      DeadAlloc s2 (L l).alloc) ∧\n     (∀ r < s3.P.length, RootPlace s3.P r → ¬ s3.Usable r → s3.freed r = false →\n      OptP (s3.P[r]?) (fun pl => pl.owner.isPlace = true) False → ∀ l ∈ footprint s3.P r,\n      LiveAlloc s2 (L l).alloc))\n    ⟨fun ⟨a, b, c, d, e, f, g, h⟩ => ⟨a, b, c, d, e, f, g, h⟩,\n     fun ⟨a, b, c, d, e, f, g, h⟩ => ⟨a, b, c, d, e, f, g, h⟩⟩\n\n/-! ## Sequences of MM-02 operations (MM-02.H, K4, K5) -/","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"fb7d5bcd-2d45-4878-bfac-1b52cbe0142b","timestamp":"2026-10-31T22:00:37.756Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"  | .frame f => some (tok f)\n  | .place _ => none\n\n/-- K3, relation of representation `Repr` between an MM-03 state `s3` and an MM-02 state `s2`, for\nthe layout `L` and the frame tokens `tok`:\n- `lwf`: `LayoutWF` (K1);\n- `inj`: two distinct root places are in distinct allocations (K2: a root corresponds to an\n  allocation; a part to a sub-range of the allocation of its root, by `LayoutWF.sameAlloc`);\n- `tokens`: the allocation of a root owned by the frame `f` has the token `tok f` (K2);\n- `live`: every usable root has its allocation live (K3);\n- `init`: every `Init` leaf has all its bytes initialised (K3);\n- `freed`: a root dead by `free` has its allocation dead (K3);\n- `exited`: a root dead by the exit of its frame has its allocation dead (K3);\n- `leaked`: a root owned by a place, not usable and not freed keeps its allocation live. K3 says\n  it of a root dead by `endUse`; the clause also covers owned storage that dies with its frame (K4:\n  no `DeallocStep` for it) or with a freed root (K4 read as one `DeallocStep`, of the freed root):\n  report, (c) 4 and (e) 7.\n`Repr` does not read the contracts `K`: no clause of K3 depends on them. -/\nstructure Repr (tok : Nat → Nat) (L : Layout) (s3 : S3) (s2 : MM02.State) : Prop where\n  lwf : LayoutWF L s3 s2\n  inj : ∀ r < s3.P.length, ∀ r' < s3.P.length, RootPlace s3.P r → RootPlace s3.P r' → r ≠ r' →\n    ∀ l ∈ footprint s3.P r, ∀ l' ∈ footprint s3.P r', (L l).alloc ≠ (L l').alloc\n  tokens : ∀ r < s3.P.length, RootPlace s3.P r → OptP (s3.P[r]?) (fun pl =>\n    OptP (tokOf tok pl.owner) (fun d => ∀ l ∈ footprint s3.P r,\n      AllocP s2 (L l).alloc (·.freeAuth = some d)) True) True\n  live : ∀ r < s3.P.length, RootPlace s3.P r → s3.Usable r → ∀ l ∈ footprint s3.P r,\n    LiveAlloc s2 (L l).alloc\n  init : ∀ l < s3.P.length, isLeaf s3.P l → s3.I l = .init →\n    AllocP s2 (L l).alloc fun a => a.InitRange (L l).off (L l).len\n  freed : ∀ r < s3.P.length, RootPlace s3.P r → s3.freed r = true → ∀ l ∈ footprint s3.P r,\n    DeadAlloc s2 (L l).alloc\n  exited : ∀ r < s3.P.length, RootPlace s3.P r → OptP (s3.P[r]?) (fun pl => FrameGone s3.F pl.owner)\n    False → ∀ l ∈ footprint s3.P r, DeadAlloc s2 (L l).alloc\n  leaked : ∀ r < s3.P.length, RootPlace s3.P r → ¬ s3.Usable r → s3.freed r = false →\n    OptP (s3.P[r]?) (fun pl => pl.owner.isPlace = true) False → ∀ l ∈ footprint s3.P r,\n    LiveAlloc s2 (L l).alloc\n\nset_option synthInstance.maxSize 4096 in\ninstance (tok : Nat → Nat) (L : Layout) (s3 : S3) (s2 : MM02.State) :\n    Decidable (Repr tok L s3 s2) :=\n  decidable_of_iff\n    (LayoutWF L s3 s2 ∧\n     (∀ r < s3.P.length, ∀ r' < s3.P.length, RootPlace s3.P r → RootPlace s3.P r' → r ≠ r' →\n      ∀ l ∈ footprint s3.P r, ∀ l' ∈ footprint s3.P r', (L l).alloc ≠ (L l').alloc) ∧\n     (∀ r < s3.P.length, RootPlace s3.P r → OptP (s3.P[r]?) (fun pl =>\n      OptP (tokOf tok pl.owner) (fun d => ∀ l ∈ footprint s3.P r,\n        AllocP s2 (L l).alloc (·.freeAuth = some d)) True) True) ∧\n     (∀ r < s3.P.length, RootPlace s3.P r → s3.Usable r → ∀ l ∈ footprint s3.P r,\n      LiveAlloc s2 (L l).alloc) ∧\n     (∀ l < s3.P.length, isLeaf s3.P l → s3.I l = .init →\n      AllocP s2 (L l).alloc fun a => a.InitRange (L l).off (L l).len) ∧\n     (∀ r < s3.P.length, RootPlace s3.P r → s3.freed r = true → ∀ l ∈ footprint s3.P r,\n      DeadAlloc s2 (L l).alloc) ∧\n     (∀ r < s3.P.length, RootPlace s3.P r →\n      OptP (s3.P[r]?) (fun pl => FrameGone s3.F pl.owner) False → ∀ l ∈ footprint s3.P r,\n      DeadAlloc s2 (L l).alloc) ∧\n     (∀ r < s3.P.length, RootPlace s3.P r → ¬ s3.Usable r → s3.freed r = false →\n      OptP (s3.P[r]?) (fun pl => pl.owner.isPlace = true) False → ∀ l ∈ footprint s3.P r,\n      LiveAlloc s2 (L l).alloc))\n    ⟨fun ⟨a, b, c, d, e, f, g, h⟩ => ⟨a, b, c, d, e, f, g, h⟩,\n     fun ⟨a, b, c, d, e, f, g, h⟩ => ⟨a, b, c, d, e, f, g, h⟩⟩\n\n/-! ## Sequences of MM-02 operations (MM-02.H, K4, K5) -/","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"serverClassifierContext":{"request":"0992792a-fea6-456c-8d7d-8c1bd3d717b8","context":{"git_state":{"cwd":"/Users/guygouri/Devlab/ernlang/ern/formal","root":"/Users/guygouri/Devlab/ernlang/ern","branch":"formal/refinement_0.1","default_branch":null,"status":{"clean":true,"counts":{"staged":0,"modified":0,"untracked":null,"untracked_normal":0},"porcelain":null,"truncated":false},"visibility":{"origin":{"host":"github.com","remote":"ernlang/ern","visibility":"public"},"push_remote":"origin","remotes":[{"name":"origin","host":"github.com","remote":"ernlang/ern","visibility":"public"}],"visibility_cache":[{"host":"github.com","remote":"ernlang/ern","visibility":"public"}]}},"live_cwd":"/Users/guygouri/Devlab/ernlang/ern/formal","platform":"macos"}},"sandboxed":false,"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"fd867c6b-87e1-40a6-9984-38f81be320d1","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reasonType":"mode"},"userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/guygouri/Devlab/ernlang/ern/formal","sessionId":"c986905c-e900-4fd9-bebc-4a3ce7ebb180","version":"2.1.309","gitBranch":"formal/refinement_0.1","slug":"effervescent-gathering-wind"}
{"type":"api-request-blob","sessionId":"c986905c-e900-4fd9-bebc-4a3ce7ebb180","hash":"110d33bbee27c8454769b7d7dcb6f864c68681af902f677047a58ef060f5d349","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""},{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I'm refactoring the pass-1 `Repr` into a base `ReprB` with the new `provTokens`/`ptok`/`provOf` parameters, while `Repr` now extends it with `MM02.WF s2`; I'll move the pass-1 transport lemmas to `ReprB` and keep the R theorems on `Repr`.\n\n","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01STEz1Nrp3UZnszEiaXQWiF","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd /Users/guygouri/Devlab/ernlang/ern/formal && cp Ern/MM23.lean /private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-guygouri-Devlab-ernlang-ern/c986905c-e900-4fd9-bebc-4a3ce7ebb180/scratchpad/p2work/MM23_p1.lean && sed -n 88,150p Ern/MM23.lean","description":"Back up pass-1 module and show the Repr structure"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}]}}
