{"parentUuid":"9aefe9aa-5332-4e9c-a22a-abcf2e9348ab","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"afea6d65-2af9-420c-969b-b55d07c96f18","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01BF5e1w854B4ZW2T1VFpiVy","type":"tool_result","content":"1413:theorem ReprB.shrink {tok ptok : Nat → Nat} {provOf : Nat → Option Nat} {L : Layout} {s3 s3' : S3} {s2 : MM02.State}\n1414-    (hR : ReprB tok ptok provOf L s3 s2) (hP : s3'.P = s3.P) (hF : s3'.F = s3.F) (hfr : s3'.freed = s3.freed)\n1415-    (hU : ∀ q, s3'.Usable q → s3.Usable q) (hI : ∀ l, s3'.I l = .init → s3.I l = .init) :\n1416-    ReprB tok ptok provOf L s3' s2 := by\n1417-  refine ⟨⟨?_, ?_, ?_⟩, ?_, ?_, ?_, ?_, ?_, ?_, ?_⟩ <;> simp only [hP, hF, hfr]\n1418-  · exact hR.lwf.sameAlloc\n1419-  · exact hR.lwf.disjoint\n1420-  · exact hR.lwf.within\n1421-  · exact hR.inj\n1422-  · exact hR.tokens\n1423-  · exact fun r hr hrt hu => hR.live r hr hrt (hU r hu)\n1424-  · exact fun l hl hlf hi => hR.init l hl hlf (hI l hi)\n1425-  · exact hR.freed\n1426-  · exact hR.exited\n1427-  · intro r hr hrt hu hf ho\n1428-    by_cases hu' : s3.Usable r\n1429-    · exact hR.live r hr hrt hu'\n1430-    · exact hR.leaked r hr hrt hu' hf ho\n1431-\n1432-/-- K3, K4: `Repr` carries over to the deallocation of the allocations `ids` when the places do\n1433-not change, no leaf becomes `Init`, a root usable after was usable before and keeps its\n1434-allocation, a root freed or exited after was so before or has its allocation deallocated, and a\n1435-leaked root after was usable or not freed before and keeps its allocation. -/","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"0197ab95-c831-47af-b0b9-4ed5a645ff16","timestamp":"2026-10-31T22:01:44.653Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"1413:theorem ReprB.shrink {tok ptok : Nat → Nat} {provOf : Nat → Option Nat} {L : Layout} {s3 s3' : S3} {s2 : MM02.State}\n1414-    (hR : ReprB tok ptok provOf L s3 s2) (hP : s3'.P = s3.P) (hF : s3'.F = s3.F) (hfr : s3'.freed = s3.freed)\n1415-    (hU : ∀ q, s3'.Usable q → s3.Usabl