{"parentUuid":"9c8bde05-83dd-4bb8-bf25-ccc12bd838a8","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgb5uE4TLSU9PB9HmzFsS","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_0165Tjc7EQTTDty14yy85KhV","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"python3 - <<'EOF'\np='Ern/MM23.lean'\ns=open(p).read()\na=\"\"\"/-- L7, exactness of the instantiation under `LayoutWF` (K1 (b))\"\"\"\ns=s.replace(a,\"\"\"/-- The layout of the counterexample satisfies `LayoutWF` on a state with one static leaf and an\nallocation of size zero: the failure is under `LayoutWF`, as L7 states it. -/\nexample : LayoutWF (fun _ => ⟨0, 0, 0⟩) (S3.init [((none, none, 0), false)])\n    (MM02.State.empty.alloc 0 0 0 1 none) := by decide\n\n\"\"\"+a,1)\nopen(p,'w').write(s)\nEOF\n~/.elan/bin/lake env lean Ern/MM23.lean 2>&1 | grep -E \"^Ern\" -A10 | head -20; ~/.elan/bin/lake build 2>&1 | grep -E \"warning|error|Build\"; ~/.elan/bin/lake env lean /private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-guygouri-Devlab-ernlang-ern/c986905c-e900-4fd9-bebc-4a3ce7ebb180/scratchpad/mm23/axcheck.lean; cd .. && git checkout formal/Ern/.gitkeep 2>/dev/null; git add formal/Ern/MM23.lean && git commit -q -F - <<'EOF'\nMM23 pass 2, step 3: ddSound_of_layout (L7)\n\nWhy: L7 asks that the instantiation of K.DeclaredDisjoint by the byte\ndisjointness of the leaves of the two regions satisfy DDSound.\n\nWhat:\n- ByteDisjoint L r r'.\n- ddSound_of_layout: if every declaration implies byte disjointness and\n  the leaves of a declared region have non-empty ranges, DDSound holds;\n  ddSound_instance for the instantiation itself.\n- Counterexample kept: with a leaf of size zero (allowed by K1 (d)) the\n  instantiation declares a region disjoint from itself and DDSound fails;\n  the layout of the counterexample satisfies LayoutWF.\n- byteDisjoint_of_leaves: under LayoutWF, leaf-disjoint lists of leaves\n  are byte-disjoint (the instantiation is not empty).\n\nHow proved: lake build clean; no sorry/admit/axiom/native_decide; all\ntheorem constants use at most propext and Quot.sound.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nEOF\ngit log --oneline -1","description":"Add LayoutWF witness for the counterexample, build, commit step 3"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3788,"cache_read_input_tokens":909176,"output_tokens":1388,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":373},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3788,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1388,"cache_read_input_tokens":909176,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3788,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3788},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"wireToolInputs":{"toolu_0165Tjc7EQTTDty14yy85KhV":{"command":"cd /Users/guygouri/Devlab/ernlang/ern/formal && python3 - <<'EOF'\np='Ern/MM23.lean'\ns=open(p).read()\na=\"\"\"/-- L7, exactness of the instantiation under `LayoutWF` (K1 (b))\"\"\"\ns=s.replace(a,\"\"\"/-- The layout of the counterexample satisfies `LayoutWF` on a state with one static leaf and an\nallocation of size zero: the failure is under `LayoutWF`, as L7 states it. -/\nexample : LayoutWF (fun _ => ⟨0, 0, 0⟩) (S3.init [((none, none, 0), false)])\n    (MM02.State.empty.alloc 0 0 0 1 none) := by decide\n\n\"\"\"+a,1)\nopen(p,'w').write(s)\nEOF\n~/.elan/bin/lake env lean Ern/MM23.lean 2>&1 | grep -E \"^Ern\" -A10 | head -20; ~/.elan/bin/lake build 2>&1 | grep -E \"warning|error|Build\"; ~/.elan/bin/lake env lean /private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-guygouri-Devlab-ernlang-ern/c986905c-e900-4fd9-bebc-4a3ce7ebb180/scratchpad/mm23/axcheck.lean; cd .. && git checkout forma